        "client_msg_id": "8a104a1d-904b-49cc-b565-348866923413",
        "text": "<@U023V63MF6V> I'll widen your question to \"why are so many bad decisions taken in the world?\", with \"bad\" in some semi-objective sense (so not just \"opposite to my opinion\").\n\nMy answer is: hubris. There are too many people who believe to know the Right Answer to complex questions and don't bother to check.",
