                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " I'll widen your question to \"why are so many bad decisions taken in the world?\", with \"bad\" in some semi-objective sense (so not just \"opposite to my opinion\").\n\nMy answer is: hubris. There are too many people who believe to know the Right Answer to complex questions and don't bother to check."
                            }
